<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>You should be scared of me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">DAMONA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">You should be scared of me</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0kyUoKAxI6UriX2nXZmmbA</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.898" end="00:14.800">Does he even feel anything?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.800" end="00:16.300">I guess he don't,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.122" end="00:22.503">but he wanna meet at strange places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.503" end="00:24.368">Nobody knows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.368" end="00:27.756">And I guess, he thinks I'm scared of him, but he is wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.756" end="00:32.008">I got all the things you want, but I'm just playing along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.008" end="00:33.866">He got guns in his pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.866" end="00:35.995">And he shoots, shoots, shoots</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.995" end="00:39.711">He got blood on his carpet, but he won't fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.711" end="00:43.430">But he feels for me so easily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.430" end="00:46.098">He's not the one you should be scared of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.098" end="00:51.371">You should be scared of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.371" end="00:58.268">He tells me secrets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.268" end="01:03.317">Nobody knows, I don't think it's good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.317" end="01:07.566">And that he told me, "Bury, bury those chords"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.566" end="01:11.291">But I will not teach you how to get out of this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.291" end="01:15.266">Baby, here I am, I'm with a deadly kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.266" end="01:17.140">He got guns in his pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.140" end="01:18.985">And he shoots, shoots, shoots</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.985" end="01:22.972">He got blood on his carpet, but he won't fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.972" end="01:26.689">But he feels for me so easily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.689" end="01:30.075">He's not the one you should be scared of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.075" end="01:31.575">You should be scared of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.140" end="01:33.273">'Cause I don't feel anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.273" end="01:37.248">And it's right, I get evil overnight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.248" end="01:39.372">Here is some advise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.372" end="01:43.651">Don't listen to my puppy eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.651" end="01:48.434">Don't listen to my puppy eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.434" end="01:50.296">He got guns in his pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.296" end="01:52.425">And he shoots, shoots, shoots</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.425" end="01:56.411">He got blood on his carpet, but he won't fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.411" end="02:00.122">But he feels for me so easily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.122" end="02:02.791">He's not the one you should be scared of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.791" end="02:04.372">You should be scared of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.372" end="02:06.236">He got guns in his pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.236" end="02:08.090">And he shoots, shoots, shoots</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.090" end="02:12.080">He got blood on his carpet, but he won't fall for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.080" end="02:15.793">But he feels for me so easily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.793" end="02:18.724">He's not the one you should be scared of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.724" end="02:22.724">You should be scared of me</p></div></body></tt>